                  Parameters for DECLUS
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
tiny.dat                    \file with data
1   2   0   1               \  columns for X, Y, Z, and variable
-1.0e21     1.0e21          \  trimming limits
tiny_declus.sum             \file for summary output
tiny_declus.out             \file for output with data & weights
1.0   1.0                   \Y and Z cell anisotropy
0                           \0=look for minimum
3  1.0  5.0                 \number of cell sizes, min size, max size
2                           \number of origin offsets
